{{- /* The public half of the same Proton Pass item. Fetched on the same terms
as the private key — see create_private_id_ed25519.tmpl.

`pass-cli item create ssh-key import` derives this field from the key material
and drops the trailing comment, which leaves ssh-add -l and ssh -v labelling
the key "no comment". The comment was put back on the item itself with
`pass-cli item update --field public_key=...`, so nothing is needed here. */ -}}
{{ protonPass (printf "%s/public_key" .protonpass.sshKeyItem) | trim }}
